    "stdout": "'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.sat_faithfulForm' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.equalityFree_equalityForm' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.sat_equalityForm' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.equalityFree_eraseEquality' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.sat_eraseEquality' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.collection_of_matrix' depends on axioms: [propext]\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.modelsFullGIC' depends on axioms: [propext]\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.faithful_of_singletons' does not depend on any axioms\n'SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC.EqualityGIC.faithful_of_pairing' does not depend on any axioms\n"
